    "rationale": "Bid-triggered (not make-triggered) on purpose: the factor applies to sets as well, which is the purest bid-tension shape. Distinct from the cut cb-bid9-xmult (×1.5 at 9, common) by budget: ×2 narrowly is the uncommon band. Shares a signature with the cut enumerated e-bid8-xmult (×3 at common, set aside at screen); ×2 at uncommon is a different budget point.",
